Hello all, I can also confirm the same issue with DM-1701 on FM transmissions. The correspondent hears a hum / buzz when the light is lower than 100%. <br>I also notice this issue in a parallel development for a different terminal, a Quansheng UV-K5. When i contacted the developer, Armel - F4HWN, <br>he said he solved the problem by changing the PWM frequency of the screen parameters. The PWM of the light driver frequency was low, and after he changed it to a higher frequency, the topic was solved. Maybe the developers in this forum can use this technical detail in their analysis. This is a constructive remark, I hope it can be used. Thanks to the developers for all the effort of bringing new features to OpenGD77 development. Great deal of respect. <br>73 de YO2AP, Giani<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=4323">YO2AP</a> — Tue May 20, 2025 8:55 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
